<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Eco-Friendly Tips</h1>
    <ul>
        {% for tip in tips %}
            <li>{{ tip.title }}: {{ tip.content }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/tips">Submit a Tip</a>
    <a href="/resources">Resources</a>
    <a href="/forum">Forum</a>
    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
</body>
</html>
```

*** templates/tips.html
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tips</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Submit Eco-Friendly Tip</h1>
    <form action="/tips" method="POST">
        <label for="title">Title:</label>
        <input type="text" id="title" name="title" required>
        <br>
        <label for="content">Content:</label>
        <textarea id="content" name="content" required></textarea>
        <br>
        <button type="submit">Submit Tip</button>
    </form>
    <h2>Existing Tips</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for tip in tips %}
            <li>{{ tip.title }}: {{ tip.content }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
</body>
</html>
```

*** templates/resources.html
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Resources</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Add Resource</h1>
    <form action="/resources" method="POST">
        <label for="title">Title:</label>
        <input type="text" id="title" name="title" required>
        <br>
        <label for="link">Link:</label>
        <input type="url" id="link" name="link" required>
        <br>
        <button type="submit">Add Resource</button>
    </form>
    <h2>Existing Resources</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for resource in resources %}
            <li><a href="{{ resource.link }}">{{ resource.title }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
</body>
</html>
```

*** templates/forum.html
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Forum</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Community Forum</h1>
    <form action="/forum" method="POST">
        <label for="content">Post:</label>
        <textarea id="content" name="content" required></textarea>
        <br>
        <button type="submit">Post</button>
    </form>
    <h2>Forum Posts</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for post in posts %}
            <li><strong>{{ post.username }}</strong>: {{ post.content }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
</body>
</html>
```

